      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "2010 The Society of Thoracic Surgeons. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We present a case of a giant right coronary artery pseudoaneurysm that presented as a right atrial intracardiac mass. Preoperatively, a two-dimensional echocardiogram, a computed tomographic scan, a magnetic resonance image, and cardiac catheterization were performed to diagnose and assess the origins of the mass."
